  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productive and export Development Program for the Province of Salta</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Productivo y Exportador de la Provincia de Salta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es promover el crecimiento econmico sostenible de la provincia de Salta, a travs delfortalecimiento de sectores con potencial de crecimiento, generacin de conocimiento, empleo e internacionalizacin.Objetivos especficos: (i) mejorar la competitividad e internacionalizacin de empresas de los sectores prioritarios a travsde inversiones en infraestructura y la provisin de financiamiento, (ii) incrementar la disponibilidad de personas capacitadascon las habilidades requeridas por empresas de los sectores priorizados, y (iii) fortalecer la capacidad de la provincia enla implementacin de una estrategia de promocin de exportaciones y atraccin de inversiones.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to promote sustainable economic growth in the province of Salta, through the strengthening of sectors with growth potential, generation of knowledge, employment and internationalization. Specific objectives: (i) improve the competitiveness and internationalization of companies in the priority sectors through investments in infrastructure and the provision of financing, (ii) increase the availability of people trained with the skills required by companies in the prioritized sectors, and (iii) strengthen the capacity of the province in the implementation of a strategy to promote exports and investment attraction.</narrative>
  </description>
